==Format==
*'''Group Stage''' ''(October 25 - November 5)''
**Three single round-robin groups of five teams each
**All series are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
***2–0 awards winner 3 points
***2–1 awards winner 2 points and loser 1 point
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top two teams}} from each group proceed to the Playoffs
**{{Bgcolortext|stayup|3rd and 4th team}} from each group proceed to the Decider Stage
**{{Bgcolortext|down|Remaining team}} is eliminated
**<span class="mw-customtoggle-Tiebreaker" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for tiebreaker rules''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Tiebreaker" style="width:600px; margin-left:45px">
*Two teams
*#Head-to-head results between tied teams
*Three teams or more
*#{{Abbr/Bo1}} tiebreaker
</div>

*'''Decider''' ''(November 6 - November 11)''
**One single round-robin group of six teams
**All series are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
***2–0 awards winner 3 points
***2–1 awards winner 2 points and loser 1 point
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top two teams}} proceed to the Playoffs
**{{Bgcolortext|down|Remaining teams}} are eliminated

*'''Playoffs''' ''(November 12 - November 16)''
**Double-elimination bracket
**Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}, all other series are {{Abbr/Bo3}}

